{"4357010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bodacious Bashup", "steam_appid": 4357010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357010/extras/747615e0465f3dc1cb4068dbea516eff.avif?t=1776666959\" width=1560 height=624 /></span>Bodacious Bashup is the ultimate battle simulation game. Easily place down NPC's on opposing teams and press the battle button to start the fight in realtime. Choose from 12 traps to also place down to form bottlenecks and make the battlefield more dangerous. Explore different combinations in 8 different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level List:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Egypt</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roman</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kingdom</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jungle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyhaven 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyhaven 2</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyhaven 3</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skyhaven 4</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The battlefield is yours, the npc's are ready to fight, and the combinations are almost endless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red and Blue will fight to the death - but only one wins!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4357010/extras/747615e0465f3dc1cb4068dbea516eff.avif?t=1776666959\" width=1560 height=624 /></span>Bodacious Bashup is the ultimate battle simulation game. Easily place down NPC's on opposing teams and press the battle button to start the fight in realtime. Choose from 12 traps to also place down to form bottlenecks and make the battlefield more dangerous. Explore different combinations in 8 different levels.</p><p class=\"bb_para